Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:07.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is ArcTools. One stack for trading, launching and\Nbuilding on Arc, the USDC-native chain by Circle. Here is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:10.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,everything it does today, in two and a half minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:19.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Terminal streams every new pair on Arc from twenty-five\Nlaunchpads: trending, new pairs, top volume, with live
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,charts, risk flags and one-click Quick Buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:31.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Sniper bot on Telegram buys at any cost the second a\Ntoken goes live. Positions, PnL cards, auto-snipe rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:37.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,copy trading, deployer-dump guard and a referral program\Npaying twenty-five percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:46.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Buy bot posts every buy into your group and ranks tokens\Non ARCTrends. Behind it, the Arc Insider index tracks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:49.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,whales, insider clusters and dev wallets in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:59.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,ArcToolsPad launches a token in one minute. Bonding curve,\Nthen automatic graduation to Uniswap. Thirty USDC for an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:02.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,instant launch, one percent on every trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:13.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,ArcLocker locks liquidity or team tokens with a public proof\Npage. No admin key over your assets. Fifty USDC per lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:22.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,ArcPredict: Bitcoin, Ethereum and Solana, up or down, every\Ntwo minutes. Winners split the pool, prices come from four
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,exchanges and land on-chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:33.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Market: hire for your token and pay only when it is\Ndelivered. USDC waits in escrow, disputes are split with a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:36.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,public note, reviews live on-chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:47.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Move money in: bridge USDC with CCTP, swap through the\Naggregator at half a percent, or buy ARCT straight from a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:48.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:56.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Send USDC as a link with ArcClaim. Set limit orders and\Nstop-losses with ArcOrders, executed on-chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:08.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Developers get the same data through the x402 API: pay per\Ncall in USDC, no keys, no subscriptions, running natively on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:08.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:16.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,All of it fits in ArcOne, the Android app: wallet, Terminal,\NPredict and Market, updated straight from the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:25.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every fee across the stack flows to one treasury that buys\Nback and burns ARCT. Over fifty-eight million tokens are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:28.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,gone already, and the counter is public.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:34.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,ArcTools. Built on Arc, running today. Start at arctools dot\Nfun.